  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "三幕旅程铺在动态银河地图上，玩家沿途作出战术路线选择，把飞船逐步调校成猎杀机器人的专用战舰。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Chart a course through a dynamic galaxy map across 3 acts, making tactical choices along the way to turn your ship into a finely tuned bot-killing machine.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140100/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每次跑局结束都能用收益购买永久飞船升级和解锁武器，让后续挑战持续积累战力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "After each run, spend your earnings on permanent ship upgrades and unlockable weapons.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140100/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "随机跑局不仅推进与机器人群的空战，也会逐步认识配音猫咪机组，并揭开队长Gigi的神秘身世。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "getting to know your crewmates, and learning more about the mysterious origins of Whisker Squadron’s leader, Gigi.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2140100/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
